  "summary": "The Trafag 8775 sensor and 879x hybrid monitor measure the density of a specified gas or gas mixture with a pair of quartz oscillators, and report it over Modbus RTU. This map is the manual's 'Legacy' configuration: scaled 16-bit density, pressure and temperature, identification, serial settings and a sensor-status discrete input.",
